Subject: [PATCH 1565/3799] soh: rename func_80A2FBB0 -> EnGb_GiveBottle

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: re-offers the bottle until the player takes it.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gb/z_en_gb.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gb/z_en_gb.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gb/z_en_gb.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gb/z_en_gb.c
index af4bae8df..dd50d3e9d 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gb/z_en_gb.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gb/z_en_gb.c
@@ -27,7 +27,8 @@ void EnGb_BuyPoe(EnGb* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_80A2F9C0 [LLM:HIGH]
 void EnGb_Talk(EnGb* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_80A2F94C [LLM:HIGH]
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80A2FB40: once the reward line is advanced it offers GI_BOTTLE.
 void EnGb_OfferBottle(EnGb* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_80A2FB40 [LLM:HIGH]
-void func_80A2FBB0(EnGb* this, PlayState* play);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80A2FBB0: re-offers the bottle until the player takes it.
+void EnGb_GiveBottle(EnGb* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_80A2FBB0 [LLM:HIGH]
